{"unit_id": "tag:006B:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本文将阐述拓扑空间（topological spaces）上层（sheaves）的基本性质。可参阅<REF_0001>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n本文的内容将由后续文档中关于景（sites）上层（sheaves）的讨论取代。不过，在这里简要定义其中一些概念或许是合适的。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "层所定义于其上的空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "拓扑空间上的层"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "层所定义于其上的景"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "景上的层"}], "notes": []}
