{"unit_id": "tag:006C:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面列出拓扑学（topology）中的基本概念。\n\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。“设<MATH_0002>是一个开覆盖（covering）”的意思是：<MATH_0003>是一个集合（set），对每个<MATH_0004>都给定一个开子集（open subset）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>是各个<MATH_0007>的并集（union）。允许<MATH_0008>，此时没有<MATH_0009>，且<MATH_0010>。在<MATH_0011>的情形下，也允许任意一个或全部<MATH_0012>为空（empty）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 等等，等等。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "下列基本概念所属的领域"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "定义开覆盖时给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "开覆盖", "context": "原文所说的是开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "开覆盖的指标集合"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "覆盖中的每一项"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并集", "context": "各个开子集的并集"}, {"source_term": "empty", "target_term": "空", "context": "允许覆盖中的开子集为空"}], "notes": []}
