{"unit_id": "tag:006E:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>预层（presheaf）<MATH_0002>（取值于集合（of sets），定义在<MATH_0003>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一条规则，它给每个开集（open）<MATH_0004>指定一个集合（set）<MATH_0005>，并给每个包含关系（inclusion）<MATH_0006>指定一个映射（map）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>，且只要<MATH_0009>，就有<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>（在<MATH_0012>上的集合预层（of presheaves of sets）之间）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是一条规则，它给每个开集（open）<MATH_0013>指定一个集合（of sets）间的映射（map）<MATH_0014>，并与限制映射（maps）相容。也就是说，只要<MATH_0015>是开集（open），图表（diagram）<MATH_0016>就交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0017>上的集合预层（of presheaves of sets）范畴（category）记作<MATH_0018>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "of sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "of sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "定义预层所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "规则所定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "of sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "说明预层取值于集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "预层赋值的对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "规则赋予开集的值"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系", "context": "开集之间的包含关系"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "对应包含关系的映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义预层之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "说明态射的源和目标是哪类预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "态射逐开集给出映射"}, {"source_term": "of sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "说明映射的源和目标是集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "态射在每个开集上给出的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "原文所指的是限制映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "交换图表所涉的开集"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "表达与限制映射相容性的图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "图表所满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "构成该范畴的预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "由集合预层组成的范畴"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006D:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n集合（set）<MATH_0001>的元素（elements）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>截面（sections）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>（属于<MATH_0002>，取在<MATH_0003>上）。对每个<MATH_0004>，映射（map）<MATH_0005>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>限制映射（restriction map）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。我们使用记号（notation）<MATH_0006>，条件是<MATH_0007>。\n这个记号（notation）与拓扑学（topology）中函数（functions）的限制（restriction）概念一致，因为若<MATH_0008>，且<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>上的截面（section），则由上述定义中限制映射（maps）的性质可得<MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一种常用记号（notation）是把开集（open）<MATH_0013>上的截面（sections）用符号（symbol）<MATH_0014>或<MATH_0015>表示。换言之，下列等式（equalities）按记号的定义即成立：\n<MATH_0016>\n本章不使用这个记号（notation），但其他章会用到。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restriction map", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "symbol", "target_term": "符号"}, {"source_term": "equalities", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由截面组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "集合里被称为截面的成员"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "给定开集上的截面"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "对应开集包含关系的映射"}, {"source_term": "restriction map", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "对所给映射命名"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "限制映射所用的记号"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "与函数限制的记法相容的记号"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "函数限制这一概念所属的领域"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "所讨论的限制的适用对象"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "拓扑学中对函数取限制的操作"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "用于说明记号的给定截面"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "其定义性质推出该式"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "用于表示开集上截面的另一种记法"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "取截面的范围"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "另一种记号所表示的对象"}, {"source_term": "symbol", "target_term": "符号", "context": "所列举的截面记号"}, {"source_term": "equalities", "target_term": "等式", "context": "按记号定义成立的等式"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "本章不采用的记法"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个集合（set）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>常值预层（constant presheaf with value）（值为<MATH_0003>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是这样一个预层（presheaf）：它把集合（set）<MATH_0004>赋给每个开集（open）<MATH_0005>，而且所有限制映射（restriction mappings）都是<MATH_0006>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "constant presheaf with value", "target_term": "常值预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "定义常值预层的空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "常值预层所取的值"}, {"source_term": "constant presheaf with value", "target_term": "常值预层", "context": "取指定值的常值预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "描述常值预层所属的类型"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "赋给各开集的同一个集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "预层赋值的对象"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "常值预层的限制映射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006G:title", "translation": "阿贝尔（Abelian）预层（presheaves）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "作为预层类型的修饰语"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "节标题所指的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006G:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节简要指出预层（presheaves）范畴（category）的一些性质，借助这些性质可以定义阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的预层（presheaves）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "构成该范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "具有所述性质的范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "所要定义的预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "借助所述性质定义的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006H:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。考虑规则<MATH_0002>，它给<MATH_0003>的每个开子集（open subset）指定一个单元素（singleton）集合（set）。由于从每个集合（set）到单元素（singleton）集合（set）都有唯一的映射（map），故存在唯一的限制映射（maps）<MATH_0004>。所得结构是<MATH_0005>上的一个取值于集合（sets）的预层（presheaf）。由上述单元素（singleton）集合（sets）的性质，它是<MATH_0006>上的集合预层（presheaves of sets）范畴（category）中的终对象（final object）。因此，在唯一同构（isomorphism）的意义下，它也是唯一的。我们有时用<MATH_0007>表示这个预层（presheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "此例给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "规则逐一赋值的子集"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素", "context": "集合恰有一个元素"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "规则赋给开子集的值"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "唯一映射的任意源集合"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素", "context": "作为映射目标的集合恰有一个元素"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "唯一映射的目标集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "任意集合到单元素集合的映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "由唯一映射性质得到的限制映射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所得预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由规则和限制映射构成的对象"}, {"source_term": "singleton", "target_term": "单元素", "context": "回指前面使用的集合性质"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "具有上述性质的集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "该范畴中的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "终对象所在的范畴"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象", "context": "该预层在所述范畴中的地位"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "表达该对象的唯一性"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "被赋予所述记号的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006I:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。<MATH_0002>上的集合预层（presheaves of sets）范畴（category）有积（products）（见范畴（Categories）中的定义<REF_0001>）。此外，积（product）<MATH_0003>在开集（open）<MATH_0004>上的截面（sections）所成的集合（set），是<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>各自在<MATH_0007>上的截面（sections）集合（sets）的积（product）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "该范畴中的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "存在积的范畴"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "范畴中存在的积"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "引用定义所在的文档标题"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积", "context": "在开集上取截面的预层积"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "取截面的开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "积预层在给定开集上的截面"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "积预层的截面组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "两个预层各自在同一开集上的截面"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "两个预层各自的截面集合"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term": "积", "context": "两个截面集合所取的积"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006I:proof", "translation": "具体地说，设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0003>上的集合预层（presheaves of sets）。考虑规则<MATH_0004>，将其记作<MATH_0005>。若<MATH_0006>均为开集（open），则定义限制映射（restriction mapping）<MATH_0007>，其作用由<MATH_0008>给出。于是立刻可见<MATH_0009>是一个预层（presheaf）。此外，还有投影映射（maps）<MATH_0010>和<MATH_0011>。任取第三个预层（presheaf）<MATH_0012>，都有<MATH_0013>，这留给读者证明。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "投影映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "两个预层定义在同一空间上"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "参与取积的两个预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "定义限制映射所涉的开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "按给定公式作用的映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "构造所得对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "投影映射", "context": "从该积出发的两个投影映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于刻画积的任意第三个预层"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006G:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，若<MATH_0001>是一个阿贝尔群（abelian group），则零与取负这两个映射（maps）由加法运算（addition law）唯一确定。换言之，说“设<MATH_0002>是一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）”是有意义的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "addition law", "target_term": "加法运算"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "给定代数结构的类型"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "零与取负对应的两个映射"}, {"source_term": "addition law", "target_term": "加法运算", "context": "唯一确定上述两个映射的运算"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "所引表述中给定的结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006J:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个取值于集合（sets）的预层（presheaf）。考虑<MATH_0003>上的下列各类结构：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个开集（open）<MATH_0004>，在<MATH_0005>上给定一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构，使得所有限制映射（maps）都是阿贝尔群（abelian group）同态（homomorphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 预层（presheaves）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0006>、预层（presheaves）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0007>和一个映射（map）<MATH_0008>（见例<REF_0001>），满足通常的阿贝尔群（abelian group）中<MATH_0009>的全部公理（axioms）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 预层（presheaves）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0010>、预层（presheaves）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0011>和一个映射（map）<MATH_0012>，使得对每个开集（open）<MATH_0013>，四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0014>是一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 预层（presheaves）之间的一个映射（map）<MATH_0015>，使得对每个开集（open）<MATH_0016>，映射（map）<MATH_0017>定义了一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n上述第（1）至第（4）类数据各自组成的全体之间存在自然双射（bijections）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "axioms", "target_term": "公理"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"sourc