{"unit_id": "tag:006G:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n该引理说，在预层（presheaves）范畴（category）中给出一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）对象（object）<MATH_0001>，等同于给出一个取值于集合（sets）的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0002>，使得每个集合（sets）<MATH_0003>都配有阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构，且所有限制映射（restriction mappings）都是群（group）同态（homomorphisms）。对于大多数代数（algebra）结构，我们将用这种方式处理这类对象（objects）的（预）层（sheaves）。也就是说，我们将这类对象（objects）的（预）层（sheaf）定义为一个取值于集合（sets）的（预）层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>，其每个截面（sections）集合（sets）<MATH_0005>都配有这种结构，且这些结构与限制映射（restriction mappings）相容。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "形成所讨论的范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "给定阿贝尔群对象的范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "范畴中对象所带的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "范畴内承载阿贝尔群结构的对象"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "co