{"unit_id": "tag:006K:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>上的阿贝尔群预层（presheaf of abelian groups）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或称<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0003>上的阿贝尔预层（abelian presheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，是一个取值于集合（sets）的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0004>，其中对每个开集（open）<MATH_0005>，集合（set）<MATH_0006>都配有阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构，且所有限制映射（maps）<MATH_0007>都是阿贝尔群（abelian groups）同态（homomorphisms）。见上面的引理<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0008>上的阿贝尔预层态射（morphism of abelian presheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003><MATH_0009>是集合预层（presheaves of sets）之间的态射（morphism），它诱导一个阿贝尔群（abelian groups）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0010>，对每个开集（open）<MATH_0011>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0012>上的阿贝尔群（abelian groups）预层（presheaves）范畴（category）记作<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf of abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian presheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "morphism of abelian presheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔预层态射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "定义阿贝尔预层所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf of abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群预层", "context": "第一个被定义的名称"}, {"source_term": "abelian presheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔预层", "context": "同一概念的另一名称"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "定义中所用预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "带有相应群结构的对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "给出群结构的取值范围"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "配有群结构的截面集合"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "给每个截面集合配备的结构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "被要求保持群结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "限制映射作为同态所涉的群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态", "context": "对所有限制映射的要求"}, {"source_term": "morphism of abelian presheaves", "target_term": "阿贝尔预层态射", "context": "该条定义的态射"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合预层", "context": "忘掉群结构后态射所涉的预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义中要求的集合预层态射"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "逐开集诱导的同态所涉的群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "在所给开集上诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "要求诱导同态的任意开集"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "范畴中预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "该范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所指定记号表示的范畴"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:006L:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。假定对每个<MATH_0002>都给定一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）<MATH_0003>。对开集（open）<MATH_0004>，令\n<MATH_0005>\n这个阿贝尔群（abelian group）的一个典型元素（element）记作<MATH_0006>，其中<MATH_0007>且<MATH_0008>。（当然，我们总可以选择一种表示方式（representation），使<MATH_0009>两两不同（pairwise distinct）。）对开集（open）<MATH_0010>，定义限制映射（restriction mapping）<MATH_0011>如下：将元素（element）<MATH_0012>映到元素（element）<MATH_0013>。这是一个阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的预层（presheaf），验证留给读者。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "representation", "target_term": "表示方式"}, {"source_term": "pairwise distinct", "target_term": "两两不同"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "构造该例所用的空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "逐个给定的群"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "逐个定义预层取值的开集"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "所记元素所属的群"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "需要给出表示的任意典型元素"}, {"source_term": "representation", "target_term": "表示方式", "context": "这里指元素的写法"}, {"source_term": "pairwise distinct", "target_term": "两两不同", "context": "表示中可以确保的互异条件"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "定义限制映射所涉的开集"}, {"source_term": "restriction mapping", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "按所给公式定义的映射"}, {"source_term": "element",